<!-- 4 Solution overview -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="kicker">Solution</div>
  <h1>Detect, attack, decide, redact, prove &mdash; all on-prem</h1>
  <p class="lead">Deterministic rules for precision, a local LLM for context, a local VLM for what is not text &mdash;
    and an <b>adversarial agent</b> that tries to re-identify people from the redacted result before anyone releases it.</p>
  <div class="flow" style="margin:6px 0 22px">
    <div class="step"><b>1 &middot; Read</b><span>PDF, scan or phone photo; PP-OCR with per-character boxes, EN + 中文.</span></div><div class="arr">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step"><b>2 &middot; Detect</b><span><span class="badge b-rule">RULE</span> <span class="badge b-llm">LLM</span> <span class="badge b-vlm">VLM</span> layers run in parallel on two cards.</span></div><div class="arr">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step" style="border-color:#be185d"><b style="color:#be185d">3 &middot; Attack</b><span>Agent reads the redacted text like an adversary; anything still identifying is added; risk score 0&ndash;100.</span></div><div class="arr">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step"><b>4 &middot; Decide</b><span>Purpose policy: redact, pseudonymise, keep year only, or keep.</span></div><div class="arr">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step"><b>5 &middot; Review</b><span>Human approves each box; unread ink flagged.</span></div><div class="arr">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step"><b>6 &middot; Export &amp; prove</b><span>Pixel-burned PDF, de-identified text, hash-chained audit.</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid3">
    <div class="card"><h3>Finds what regex cannot</h3><p>Names in narratives, the role of each person (patient vs. physician vs. witness),
      quasi-identifiers, handwritten fields, signatures, ID photos and red seals.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Checks its own work</h3><p>Detection asks "what is PII?". The agentic check asks the question that matters for release:
      <i>"could someone still tell who this is?"</i> &mdash; and shows the answer as a risk score.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Built for production</h3><p>Single document review, batch mode for archives, live system page for operators.
      One command deploys it on a 2&times; B70 host.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span>RedactAgent &middot; ASUS UGen AI League 2026 &middot; Final</span><span>4</span></div>
</section>

